msgid ""
"# Qwen3.5 Megatron NPU 使用指南\n"
""
msgstr ""
"# Qwen3.5 Megatron NPU User Guide\n"
""

msgid ""
"本文用于指导在 Ascend NPU 上使用 verl + Megatron + vLLM 跑通 Qwen3.5-35B-A3B 和 Qwen3.5-122B-A10B GRPO 示例。\n"
""
msgstr ""
"This guide describes how to run the Qwen3.5-35B-A3B and Qwen3.5-122B-A10B GRPO samples on an Ascend NPU using verl, Megatron, and vLLM.\n"
""

