msgid ""
"## 启动训练\n"
""
msgstr ""
"## Start training\n"
""

msgid ""
"训练前需要先启动 Ray 集群。通用多节点说明可参考 [Multinode Training](../../../../start/multinode.rst)，Ascend 多节点脚本示例可参考 [昇腾 SGLang 最佳实践](ascend_sglang_best_practices.rst)。\n"
""
msgstr ""
"Before training, start the Ray cluster. For general multi-node instructions, refer to [Multinode Training](../../../../start/multinode.rst). For Ascend multi-node script examples, refer to [Ascend SGLang Best Practices](ascend_sglang_best_practices.rst).\n"
""

msgid ""
"最小启动方式如下，单机任务只需要执行 head 节点命令；多机任务需要在其他节点执行 worker 节点命令。`MASTER_ADDR` 在所有节点上保持一致，`CURRENT_IP` 设置为当前节点 IP。\n"
""
msgstr ""
"The minimal startup method is as follows. For single-machine tasks, execute only the head node command. For multi-machine tasks, execute the worker node command on other nodes. Keep `MASTER_ADDR` consistent across all nodes, and set `CURRENT_IP` to the current node IP.\n"
""

msgid ""
"通过 `ray status` 确认 NPU 资源数量符合预期后，在主节点执行训练脚本。Qwen3.5-35B-A3B 默认需要 16 个 NPU 资源，Qwen3.5-122B-A10B 默认需要 64 个 NPU 资源。\n"
""
msgstr ""
"After you confirm that the number of NPU resources is as expected using `ray status`, run the training script on the primary node. By default, Qwen3.5-35B-A3B requires 16 NPU resources, and Qwen3.5-122B-A10B requires 64 NPU resources.\n"
""

